 },
 "description": "Free. Brazilian company (CNPJ) registration check at the Receita Federal: status (ATIVA/BAIXADA/INAPTA...), legal name, CNAE, size, age, normalized address. Structured JSON plus a summary in English and Portuguese, with sources[] and data_freshness. Rate limited (50/day).",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
